 with 
\begin_inset Formula $d\leq n$
\end_inset

, one has 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align}
\|\bm{E}\bm{A}\|_{2,\infty}\leq4\sigma\sqrt{\log n}\,\|\bm{A}\|_{\mathrm{F}}+(6B\log n)\|\bm{A}\|_{2,\infty}\label{eq:E-concentration-inf2-general}
\end{align}

\end_inset

with probability at least 
\begin_inset Formula $1-2n^{-5}$
