 & \|\bm{E}\bm{U}^{\star}\|_{2,\infty}\leq4\sigma\sqrt{\log n}\,\|\bm{U}^{\star}\|_{\mathrm{F}}+(6B\log n)\|\bm{U}^{\star}\|_{2,\infty}\nonumber \\
 & \qquad=4\sigma\sqrt{r\log n}+6B\sqrt{\frac{\mu r\log^{2}n}{n}}\leq(4+6c_{\mathsf{b}})\sigma\sqrt{r\log n},\label{eq:EU-2-inf-bound-general}
