 & \leq\frac{4\big\|\big(\bm{M}-\bm{M}^{(l)}\big)\bm{U}^{(l)}\big\|_{\mathrm{F}}}{\lambda_{r}^{\star}}.\label{eq:UU-UlUl-UB1}
